1	=== README.md
2	     1	# Harbor
3	     2	
4	     3	Ops dashboard for the services we run. It renders pages on the server from
5	     4	the snapshots the deploy pipeline writes to `data/` every minute; it never
6	     5	talks to the services itself.
7	     6	
8	     7	## Running
9	     8	
10	     9	    npm start        # http://localhost:3000
11	    10	    npm test
12	    11	
13	    12	No dependencies; Node 20 or later.
14	    13	
15	    14	## Layout
16	    15	
17	    16	- `src/server.js` routes requests and wraps each page in `src/layout.js`.
18	    17	- `src/pages/` has one module per page.
19	    18	- `src/ui/` is the component library from the Harbor admin template the
20	    19	  dashboard was started from.
21	    20	- `public/` holds the template's stylesheet and script (`harbor.css`,
22	    21	  `harbor.js`) and the dashboard's own stylesheet (`app.css`).
23	    22	- `data/` holds the pipeline's snapshots.
